extends layout

block content
  div.about-page

    div.about-hero
      h1 About Student Society Hub
      p.about-intro Welcome to the Student Society Hub — a platform designed to help Roehampton University students discover, join and engage with societies on campus.

    div.about-grid
      div.about-card
        div.about-card-icon 🎯
        h3 Our Mission
        p We believe university life is about more than just studying. Societies bring students together, build communities and create memories that last a lifetime.

      div.about-card
        div.about-card-icon 🏛️
        h3 Who We Are
        p Built by students at Roehampton University, the Society Hub was created to solve a real problem — scattered communication and hard to find society information.

      div.about-card
        div.about-card-icon ✨
        h3 What We Offer
        p Students can discover societies that match their interests, join them with one click, stay updated with announcements and RSVP to events — all in one place.

      div.about-card
        div.about-card-icon 🛠️
        h3 For Society Admins
        p Society organisers can manage their members, post announcements, create events and track attendance through a dedicated admin dashboard.

      div.about-card
        div.about-card-icon 🔒
        h3 Privacy & Safety
        p We take student data seriously. Your information is only used to connect you with societies — never shared with third parties.

      div.about-card
        div.about-card-icon 📬
        h3 Contact Us
        p For support or questions email us at
          a(href="mailto:hub@roehampton.ac.uk")  hub@roehampton.ac.uk

    div.about-cta
      h2 Ready to get involved?
      p Join a society today and make the most of your university experience.
      a.about-btn(href="/login") Get Started